Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted. Local patch; not submitted upstream.

Classify NetBSD wscons pointer nodes by their kernel driver.

wsmouse(4) reports the same type for a mouse and a precision touchpad.
Read the autoconf parent through drvctl(4) and set ID_INPUT_TOUCHPAD for
imt(4) nodes and ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN for gt9xx(4) nodes. Compositors use
ID_INPUT_TOUCHPAD to select the devices that a touchpad toggle controls.
A gt9xx node no longer carries ID_INPUT_MOUSE.

--- udev-dev.c.orig
